    "title": "The McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition in Photos - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Erik Shilling ,\n8 hours ago The McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition has a hand-painted livery to celebrate McLaren’s latest Constructors’ Championship. Read more about this incredible car here .\n1.\nMcLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition\n2.\nThe rear end of the McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition sneaks out.\n3.\nThe passenger side entry on the McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition.\n4.\nThe McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition’s seats commemorating its 10th constructors championship.\n5.\nLando Norris’s signature on the McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition.\n6.\nThe McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition from above.\nView Full Gallery (6 Photos)",
    "summary": "8 hours ago The McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition has a hand-painted livery to celebrate McLaren’s latest Constructors’ Championship. McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition The rear end of the McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition sneaks out. The passenger side entry on the McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition. Lando Norris’s signature on the McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition. The McLaren Artura Spider MCL39 Championship Edition from above.",
